  "details": {
   "biography": {
    "value": "<p>A blank-faced copy of one character: the one who has left the least behind, if there is a choice. It steps out of the far door on the second pass through the Corridor Between. It has that character's sheet with every number halved and no name.</p><p><strong>Running it.</strong> Replace this placeholder with the real sheet: copy the character's actor, halve every number, blank the name. The two traits below are the rules that matter. It stops the moment the loop breaks.</p>",
